{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55420","headline":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 四 · 沈彬","name":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叶老游蜂不更忙，春残去去好思量。\n倚根托蒂花犹落，损力耗心谁可常。\n江树不能留野水，晚烟多共恨斜阳。\n感时伤事皆头白，几个渔竿遇帝主。\n（见同治十一年刊锡荣纂《萍乡县志》卷六）（按：《萍乡县志》收沈诗爲宋初之作，误。\n民国间李有鋆纂《昭萍志略》卷十二已改归唐代。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}